BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260908T230000Z
DTEND:20260909T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260908T000000Z
SUMMARY:Silent Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Silent Book Club! There's no assigned reading 
 here—just bring whatever you’re reading right now. Free tea and hot 
 cocoa provided. All reading formats are welcome. Whether you prefer 
 traditional books\, magazines\, e-readers\, or audiobooks\, there's a place 
 for you here.\n\nHow It Works\n\n\n	First 45 minutes: Quiet reading 
 time\n	Last 15 minutes: Optional discussion about our reads and 
 recommendations\n
LOCATION:Baxter-Davidson Room
CATEGORIES:Book Club
UID:LibCal-7393-17302321
URL:https://davidson.libcal.com/calendar/events/silent-book-club
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260910T220000Z
DTEND:20260910T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20260910T000000Z
SUMMARY:Speed Friending
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a low-key way to meet new people on campus? Join us 
 for Speed Friending at the library! Come hang out at the library\, grab 
 free bubble tea\, and rotate seats every few minutes to chat with everyone 
 there.
LOCATION:Lilly Family Gallery
CATEGORIES:Special Event, Student Wellness
UID:LibCal-7393-17496910
URL:https://davidson.libcal.com/event/17496910
END:VEVENT
