BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260924T220000Z
DTEND:20260925T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260924T000000Z
SUMMARY:Fall Puzzle Competition
DESCRIPTION:It's back—join us for our Fall Puzzle Competition! The first 
 team to complete a 500-piece puzzle will win a Davidson College Library 
 prize package. Team entries will be capped at 6 teams. Teams may consist of 
 1–4 people. For teams with multiple players\, please register all 
 teammates at once. Your team will get to keep the puzzle once the 
 competition has concluded. Entry is free!
LOCATION:Lilly Family Gallery
CATEGORIES:Special Event, Student Wellness
UID:LibCal-7393-17302770
URL:https://davidson.libcal.com/event/17302770
END:VEVENT
