BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261001T150000Z
DTEND:20261001T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20261001T000000Z
SUMMARY:Browsing Book Fair
DESCRIPTION:Looking for your next read? Join us in the Lilly Family Gallery 
 to see what our Browsing Collection has to offer and enjoy a Nothing Bundt 
 Cake (while supplies last)! Check out a book for a FREE limited-edition 
 mini tote bag and a chance to enter our prize drawing.
LOCATION:Lilly Family Gallery
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-7393-17693001
URL:https://davidson.libcal.com/event/17693001
END:VEVENT
